[
  {
    "bg": "00027",
    "bgm": "016"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さて、そろそろ咲耶が来る時間だな──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0243",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おはようございます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、来たな……\r\n咲耶、おはよ──……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、どうしたんだいプロデューサー\r\nなんだか、とても愉快なものを見た顔だね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030060020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……\r\n咲耶の髪が、いつもと違ったものだから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。心境の変化……と言いたいところだけど\r\nいたってシンプルな理由さ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今日はペットショップの取材だから\r\n動物を触るためにしゃがむことも多いかと思ってね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そんな時、髪が長いと地面についてしまう\r\nだから、こうしてまとめただけだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど。そうだったのか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ。それに、今日はウサギの赤ん坊を\r\n紹介すると聞いていたからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の髪があたって、\r\nくすぐったい思いをさせるわけにはいかないだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "この髪型だったら、心置きなく触れ合えると思ってね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（咲耶のことだから、\r\nこっちのほうが一番の理由だろうな……）",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにしても……\r\n髪型が違うだけなのに、雰囲気が随分変わるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……似合わないかな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、いつもと少し雰囲気が違って驚いたけど……\r\nうん、その髪型も、咲耶にとても似合っている",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶の新しい魅力を見ることができて\r\nみんなも喜ぶと思うぞ",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "みんな……か\r\nそれには、アナタも含まれているのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、勿論だ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006005010110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それなら……\r\n……フフ、良かった",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600501/2006005010110"
  },
